@thepantproject challenged me to test out their anti-spill pants. Let’s find out…

Putting their Water Repellent Pants to the ultimate test to see if the Smart-Tech fabric actually holds up. From sneaker-spray-level stain resistance to a stretchable waistband and zero-iron wrinkle-free material, these are built for everyday wear without the stress. Most importantly, the clean, tailored fit sits perfectly over the kicks. Challenge passed.

